{"speciesId":813,"names":{"fr":"Flambino","es":"Scorbunny","en":"Scorbunny","ja":"ヒバニー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il court pour augmenter sa température et faire circuler l’énergie incandescente dans son corps. Il peut ainsi déployer toute sa puissance."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se pone a correr para elevar su temperatura corporal y propagar la energía ígnea por todo el cuerpo. Desata así su verdadera fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A warm-up of running around gets fire energy coursing through this Pokémon’s body. Once that happens, it’s ready to fight at full power."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"走りまわって 体温を 上げると 炎エネルギーが 体を 巡り 本来の 力を 発揮できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Quand il est prêt à se battre, la partie qui surmonte son museau ainsi que les coussinets de ses pattes postérieures émettent de la chaleur."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando se prepara para combatir, irradia calor por la punta de la nariz y el pelo que le recubre las patas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and one on its nose. Once it’s raring to fight, these pads radiate tremendous heat."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"戦う 準備が 整うと 鼻の 頭と 足の 裏の 肉球が 高熱を 発する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":813,"moves":[{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[20,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[20,"level-up",36],[25,"level-up",36],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"ember","learns":[[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[20,"machine",0